#: ../../language/attributes/export_name.md:1
msgid "Export Name Attribute"
msgstr "导出名称属性"

#: ../../language/attributes/export_name.md:3
msgid ""
"The `#export_name` attribute assigns a stable exported symbol name to a "
"public function in a package declared with `pkgtype(kind: "
"\"foreign_library\")`. The name is used in generated Wasm, JavaScript, or"
" C output:"
msgstr ""
"`#export_name` 属性为使用 `pkgtype(kind: \"foreign_library\")` "
"声明的包中的公开函数指定稳定的导出符号名称。该名称用于生成的 Wasm、JavaScript 或 C 输出："

#: ../../language/attributes/export_name.md:7
msgid ""
"#export_name(\"add\")\n"
"pub fn add_one(value : Int) -> Int {\n"
"  value + 1\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/attributes/export_name.md:14
msgid ""
"The exported name must be a unique valid C symbol identifier. The "
"attribute cannot be used on generic functions, functions with optional "
"arguments, methods, or declarations without a body. It exports only "
"functions defined in the current package; dependency symbols are not re-"
"exported."
msgstr ""
"导出名称必须是唯一且有效的 C "
"符号标识符。该属性不能用于泛型函数、带可选参数的函数、方法或没有函数体的声明。它只导出当前包中定义的函数；不会重新导出依赖中的符号。"

#: ../../language/attributes/export_name.md:20
msgid ""
"The native backend does not currently support exporting a "
"`foreign_library` package as a library artifact. Use Wasm or JavaScript "
"if you need an exported library."
msgstr ""
"native 后端目前不支持将 `foreign_library` 包导出为库产物。如需导出的库，请使用 Wasm 或 JavaScript。"

#: ../../language/attributes/export_name.md:25
msgid ""
"See [Export Functions](/language/ffi.md#export-functions) for package "
"configuration and backend-specific alternatives."
msgstr "有关包配置及特定于后端的替代方案，请参阅[导出函数](/language/ffi.md#export-functions)。"
